ore during anti-ICE protest, throw cans and bottles]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128647293.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-students-storm-cincinnati-kroger-store-during-anti-ice-protest-throw-cans-and-bottles/articleshow/128647293.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-students-storm-cincinnati-kroger-store-during-anti-ice-protest-throw-cans-and-bottles/articleshow/128647293.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-21T19:51:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128647293,imgsize-50928.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nigeria: At least 38 killed after armed 'bandits' open fire in Zamfara village]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128646407.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[At least 38 people were killed in a pre-dawn attack by armed men on Dutse Dan Ajiya village in Nigeria's Zamfara State. Local authorities reported the remote village, with limited access, was besieged by 'bandits' who opened fire indiscriminately. This incident highlights the ongoing violence in the region despite military deployments.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/nigeria-at-least-38-killed-after-armed-bandits-open-fire-in-zamfara-village/articleshow/128646407.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/nigeria-at-least-38-killed-after-armed-bandits-open-fire-in-zamfara-village/articleshow/128646407.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-21T19:19:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128646331,imgsize-684049.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Indian nepotism, no gaming background': Internet slams Microsoft for hiring Asha Sharma as CEO of Xbox]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128643266.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-nepotism-no-gaming-background-internet-slams-microsoft-for-hiring-asha-sharma-as-ceo-of-xbox-gaming/articleshow/128643266.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-nepotism-no-gaming-background-internet-slams-microsoft-for-hiring-asha-sharma-as-ceo-of-xbox-gaming/articleshow/128643266.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-21T18:13:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128643266,imgsize-552754.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[“I am not a Zionist”: Hugh Laurie responds after Dana Eden tribute sparks backlash]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128640514.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[British actor Hugh Laurie's tribute to late producer Dana Eden ignited a social media firestorm. What began as a personal expression of grief over Eden's sudden death in Athens quickly devolved into political accusations and online abuse. Laurie firmly denied being a Zionist and vowed to block those celebrating his friend's demise, highlighting the rapid politicization of personal loss online.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/i-am-not-a-zionist-hugh-laurie-responds-after-dana-eden-tribute-sparks-backlash/articleshow/128640514.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/i-am-not-a-zionist-hugh-laurie-responds-after-dana-eden-tribute-sparks-backlash/articleshow/128640514.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-21T16:12:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128641697,imgsize-548640.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Pakistan poverty explodes, inequality at 27-year high as economic crisis deepens]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128640989.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Pakistan's poverty has surged to an 11-year high of 29%, with 70 million people now in extreme poverty. Income inequality has also reached a 27-year peak of 32.7.  These increases are attributed to IMF stabilization policies, natural disasters, and weak growth, leading to a 12% fall in real household income over seven years.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/pakistan-poverty-explodes-inequality-at-27-year-high-as-economic-crisis-deepens/articleshow/128640989.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/pakistan-poverty-explodes-inequality-at-27-year-high-as-economic-crisis-deepens/articleshow/128640989.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-21T15:39:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128641011,imgsize-1054414.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Streamer Clavicular breaks silence on Polymarket 20% prediction during Piers Morgan Uncensored after charges were dropped]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128629608.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Clavicular reacted after Polymarket predicted a 20 percent chance he could be charged with a crime by June 30. Speaking on the Piers Morgan Uncensored, he said he would try to stay out of trouble. His recent Arizona arrest was dismissed, but controversy and online speculation continue to follow him.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/streamer-clavicular-breaks-silence-on-polymarket-20-prediction-during-piers-morgan-uncensored-after-charges-were-dropped/articleshow/128629608.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/streamer-clavicular-breaks-silence-on-polymarket-20-prediction-during-piers-morgan-uncensored-after-charges-were-dropped/articleshow/128629608.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-21T06:32:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128629582,imgsize-1989473.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[UAE launches pioneering gene therapy to treat autism and rare brain disorders in children]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/128638625.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The UAE has launched two gene therapy projects targeting the root causes of autism and rare brain disorders, marking a significant shift from symptom management to biological repair. Collaborating with global experts, these initiatives aim to enhance treatment effectiveness and safety for children with conditions like BPAN, paving the way for future inherited disease therapies.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-launches-pioneering-gene-therapy-to-treat-autism-and-rare-brain-disorders-in-children/articleshow/128638625.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-launches-pioneering-gene-therapy-to-treat-autism-and-rare-brain-disorders-in-children/articleshow/128638625.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-02-21T14:28:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-128639314,imgsize-66164.cms"/></item></channel></rss>